## File Organization

### Theme Structure
```
/assets           → CSS, JS, images, fonts
/config           → settings_schema.json, settings_data.json
/layout           → theme.liquid, checkout.liquid
/locales          → en.default.json, translations
/sections         → Reusable content blocks with schema
/snippets         → Small components (no schema)
/templates        → Page templates (product.liquid, collection.liquid)
  /customers      → Customer account templates
```

### When to Use What
- **Section**: Needs customization UI in theme editor (has `{% schema %}`)
- **Snippet**: Reusable HTML/Liquid without customization UI
- **Template**: Page-level structure (product, collection, cart, etc.)

### Naming Conventions
```
sections/section-hero.liquid
sections/section-featured-collection.liquid
sections/section-buy-box.liquid

snippets/product-card.liquid
snippets/cart-drawer.liquid
snippets/icon-library.liquid

assets/component-buy-box.css
assets/module-bundle-builder.js
```

---

## Consumer Electronics Specific Patterns

### Technical Specifications Display
```liquid
{%- # Metafields for technical specs -%}
{% if product.metafields.specs.wattage %}
  <dl class="specs-list">
    <div class="specs-list__item">
      <dt>Wattage</dt>
      <dd>{{ product.metafields.specs.wattage }}</dd>
    </div>
    <div class="specs-list__item">
      <dt>Cable Length</dt>
      <dd>{{ product.metafields.specs.cable_length }}</dd>
    </div>
  </dl>
{% endif %}
```

### Compatibility Checker
```liquid
{%- # Device compatibility display -%}
{% if product.metafields.compatibility.devices %}
  <div class="compatibility">
    <h3>Compatible Devices</h3>
    <ul>
      {% for device in product.metafields.compatibility.devices.value %}
        <li>{{ device }}</li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
{% endif %}
```

### Warranty Information
```liquid
{%- # Warranty badge -%}
{% if product.metafields.warranty.years %}
  <div class="warranty-badge">
    <svg><!-- Shield icon --></svg>
    <span>{{ product.metafields.warranty.years }}-Year Warranty Included</span>
  </div>
{% endif %}
```

